# Copy to `.env` and point at your deployed Worker.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables at bundle time, so this ends up in the
# app bundle — only put non-secret values here. When it is unset the app falls
# back to the catalog bundled in src/core/catalog.ts and shows an offline bar.
EXPO_PUBLIC_PULSE_API=https://pulse-events-api.your-subdomain.workers.dev
